    questionText: "(a) Discuss two advantages of using timber frame for the construction of the garden office. (b) Draw a large freehand sketch of the given design and show your preferred location for each of the following in the garden office: corner desk; two windows; bookcase unit; seating area. Give one reason for selecting each location. (c) Discuss one advantage and one disadvantage of constructing a garden office separate from the home.",
