    stem: "The sketch shows a site dumper in operation on a construction site.",
    questionText: "(a) Describe two safety precautions that the driver must observe when operating a site dumper. (b) Using notes and freehand sketches, show three items of personal protective equipment (PPE) which should be worn by workers when working with construction vehicles. Give one specific reason why each item of personal protective equipment must be worn. (c) Give two reasons why vehicle operators must undertake a specific training course prior to operating a vehicle on a construction site.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed"}, totalMarks: 50,
    rows: [
    { id: "a-precaution-1", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Safety precaution 1", marks: 6, contextNote: "Such as: wear suitable PPE (hard hat, steel-toe boots, hi-visibility clothing); inspect the vehicle before use; always wear the seatbelt; check the area for obstacles, holes or overhead power lines.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6] },
    { id: "a-precaution-2", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Safety precaution 2", marks: 6, contextNote: "A second, different precaution. Such as: cordon off the area where the dumper operates; be trained in its use; never jump on or off — three points of contact; stay vigilant of the surroundings and others.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6] },
    { id: "b-ppe-1", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Item of PPE 1 and specific reason (5 + 3 marks)", marks: 8, contextNote: "Item 5 and specific reason 3. Such as: a hard hat, protecting the head from impacts or falling material.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] },
    { id: "b-ppe-2", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Item of PPE 2 and specific reason (5 + 3 marks)", marks: 8, contextNote: "A second, different item: 5 + 3. Such as: a high-visibility vest, so vehicle operators see workers and avoid accidents.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] },
    { id: "b-ppe-3", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Item of PPE 3 and specific reason (5 + 3 marks)", marks: 8, contextNote: "A third, different item: 5 + 3. Such as: ear defenders against machinery noise; safety glasses against flying debris; safety boots against dropped heavy materials.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] },
    { id: "c-reason-1", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Reason 1", marks: 7, contextNote: "Such as: regulations require specific certifications or licences; training teaches safety protocols, reducing accidents.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7] },
    { id: "c-reason-2", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Reason 2", marks: 7, contextNote: "A second, different reason. Such as: the knowledge to operate the equipment effectively; identifying and mitigating risks; greater efficiency; proper maintenance that extends the vehicle’s life.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7] },
    ],
